		{
			dependencies: ["5E402C739E34B7D4"]
			description: ["&eTwo heavy wheels turn toward their shared gap, drawing material inward and breaking it between their surfaces. This continuous crushing separates useful products from ore, stone, and sediment without repeated hand strikes.&r"]
